{"additions":2,"author":{"id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMTA5NDkz","is_bot":false,"login":"td72","name":"Kohei Hosokawa"},"body":"## v0.13.0\n\n- #169 — Projects: boards are fetched with hand-written GraphQL — about 3 points per board instead of ~50 (the `gh project` CLI path stays as the fallback)\n- #170 — demos and integration tests replay recorded `gh` output (`mise run demo:all` needs no network; `mise run fixtures:refresh` is the only API-using step)\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01TreGn5Xh4PjDRv9Yo4QU4w","changedFiles":2,"comments":[],"createdAt":"2026-09-08T13:08:38Z","deletions":2,"headRefName":"release/0.13.0","labels":[],"number":175,"reviewDecision":"","reviews":[{"id":"PRR_kwDORNPWJs8AAAABMn50Dg","author":{"login":"copilot-pull-request-reviewer"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"### 🟢 Approval recommended\n\nThe changes are a straightforward and consistent version bump in the manifest and lockfile with no functional code impact.\n\n<details>\n<summary>Pull request overview</summary>\n\nBumps the `vig` crate version for the v0.13.0 release, aligning the package manifest and lockfile so downstream tooling and builds reflect the new release version.\n\n**Changes:**\n- Update `Cargo.toml` package version to `0.13.0`.\n- Update the corresponding `vig` entry in `Cargo.lock` to `0.13.0`.\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>File summaries</summary>\n\n| File | Description |\r\n| ---- | ----------- |\r\n| Cargo.toml | Updates the crate’s declared package version to v0.13.0. |\r\n| Cargo.lock | Keeps the lockfile’s `vig` package entry in sync with the new version. |\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>Review details</summary>\n\n- **Files reviewed:** 1/2 changed files\n- **Comments generated:** 0\n- **Review effort level:** Lite\n</details>\n\n---\n\n💡 <a href=\"/td72/vig/new/main?filename=.github/skills/code-review/SKILL.md\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Add a `c